  "schema": "blind_v2_bound_register/1",
  "unclassified": [],
  "what_this_is": "Every bound Blind Challenge v2 relies on, with the class this challenge is willing to defend for it. SOURCE_BACKED means a cited source prints the number. ANALYTICALLY_DERIVED means the bound follows from the algebra of the quantity, including the definitional bound of 1 on a fraction-of-a-declared-rating. CONTRACT_DECLARED means the record states a band and the band is a fact about the record. INTERNAL_POLICY means a repository convention with no source behind the number."
}
